{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/extras/Banner.png?t=1748343645\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build with water, then defend against fire in wave-based survival that\u2019s easy to pick up but intense to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create walls, then unleash the flames whenever you\u2019re ready\u2014fire spreads fast, so it\u2019s great for destroying enemies but can quickly get out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fire spreads quickly\u2014great for burning enemies, but watch out if it goes too far. Water can douse flames or knock back attackers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each assault gets tougher in a paper-art world where everything folds, burns, and splashes as you fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you find the right balance between chaos and control, or watch your fortress go up in smoke? Charge in when you\u2019re ready\u2014the fire will always come!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3596730?t=1748343645","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/c4b98a97f87f2187788a256c303a80d76eead64c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748343645","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/8a1fa71c2971996223604f48c42b1cd172f46814/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748343645","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/8a1fa71c2971996223604f48c42b1cd172f46814/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748343645","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/extras/Banner.png?t=1748343645\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build with water, then defend against fire in wave-based survival that\u2019s easy to pick up but intense to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create walls, then unleash the flames whenever you\u2019re ready\u2014fire spreads fast, so it\u2019s great for destroying enemies but can quickly get out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fire spreads quickly\u2014great for burning enemies, but watch out if it goes too far. Water can douse flames or knock back attackers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each assault gets tougher in a paper-art world where everything folds, burns, and splashes as you fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you find the right balance between chaos and control, or watch your fortress go up in smoke? Charge in when you\u2019re ready\u2014the fire will always come!</p>","developers":["Hectiq"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/aec866b88dc2bd8deff677ee8ac47418998ff7bc/header.jpg?t=1748343645","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Paper Castle","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processo